response:
The report details a cyberattack campaign attributed to UAC-0098 targeting Ukrainian entities via phishing emails masquerading as the State Tax Service of Ukraine. The emails distributed a ZIP archive "НакладенняШтрафнихСанкцiй.zip" containing a malicious DOCX file "Накладення штрафних санкцій.docx", which exploited CVE-2022-30190 to fetch and execute "index.html" (hosted at 64.190.113.51), which subsequently downloaded and executed Cobalt Strike Beacon ("ked.dll", hosted at 5.199.173.152).

